    "detailed_description": "&quot;The Fading of Nicole Wilson&quot; is a story-driven, folk-horror adventure game dealing with topics like authenticity, personal sacrifice and the cost of fitting in while daring players to unravel a dark, thrilling mystery.<br><br>Brit, a teenager feeling left behind in her backwater hometown, lands a ghost-hunting job at the secluded Timberline Hotel. She hopes to capture footage that will make her famous. But when her employer is hospitalized, Brit must handle the investigation alone.<br><br>As she arrives at the desolate, crumbling estate, Brit quickly realizes there are more dangerous forces at play than any supernatural entity.<br><br>Equipped with her camera and an array of ghost-hunting gear, she descends into the hotel's shadowy corridors, determined to uncover its secrets. However, her investigation takes an unexpected turn as she discovers a web of unsettling clues hinting at a far more sinister truth hidden within the hotel's history that has never been told before.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A narrative adventure game combining exploration, puzzle solving and investigation<br></li><li>Explore beautiful and haunting locations in Lewis &amp; Clark County, uncovering Helena\u2019s grim, secret truth<br></li><li>Binaural audio for a truly immersive experience<br></li><li>Intriguing, touching and adult storytelling, combining mystery with a folk horror<br></li><li>Flawed, relatable characters confronting a net of schemes and lies</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;The Fading of Nicole Wilson&quot; is a story-driven, folk-horror adventure game dealing with topics like authenticity, personal sacrifice and the cost of fitting in while daring players to unravel a dark, thrilling mystery.<br><br>Brit, a teenager feeling left behind in her backwater hometown, lands a ghost-hunting job at the secluded Timberline Hotel. She hopes to capture footage that will make her famous. But when her employer is hospitalized, Brit must handle the investigation alone.<br><br>As she arrives at the desolate, crumbling estate, Brit quickly realizes there are more dangerous forces at play than any supernatural entity.<br><br>Equipped with her camera and an array of ghost-hunting gear, she descends into the hotel's shadowy corridors, determined to uncover its secrets. However, her investigation takes an unexpected turn as she discovers a web of unsettling clues hinting at a far more sinister truth hidden within the hotel's history that has never been told before.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A narrative adventure game combining exploration, puzzle solving and investigation<br></li><li>Explore beautiful and haunting locations in Lewis &amp; Clark County, uncovering Helena\u2019s grim, secret truth<br></li><li>Binaural audio for a truly immersive experience<br></li><li>Intriguing, touching and adult storytelling, combining mystery with a folk horror<br></li><li>Flawed, relatable characters confronting a net of schemes and lies</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Feeling stuck in her backwater hometown, Brit jumps at the chance for a life-changing adventure at the derelict Timberline Hotel. Her chance of a quick rise to fame, however, soon turns into a grim investigation as both the living and the dead are hiding dark secrets behind its abandoned walls.",
